          hints: ['Differentiate each candidate with the chain rule and see which gives back the integrand.', String.raw`$\frac{\mathrm d}{\mathrm d x}e^{-x^2} = -2x\,e^{-x^2}$. Which constant $k$ makes $k\cdot(-2x) = x$?`],
